 ## Background
-The method was proposed by Liu et al. [LCDP13] and further utilized by Hadwiger et al. [HAAB+ 18] [S1, unofficial]. It is part of the broader effort to handle empty-space skipping and cache residency in volume rendering [S1, unofficial]. The technique is described in the context of scalable web-based volume rendering of large biomedical datasets [S1, unofficial].
